## Phase B — derived metrics

Metric definitions (see `metrics.py`):
- `points_per_game`: points / games_played (qualified: gp >= 5)
- `game_changer_index`: points + 2 * game_winning_goals
- `two_way_impact`: points + ground_balls + caused_turnovers + draw_controls - turnovers
- `shooting_efficiency`: shot_percentage, among players with >= 20 shots
- `most_improved`: NOT computable from season totals; would require per-game player data (box scores) to compare first-half vs second-half points-per-game.

