## Data-quality note

Player goals sum to 234, but the team scored 235 (per both the published Total row and the game-by-game log). The per-player table is internally off by one goal — a real quirk in the published data. We treat the game log's 235 as team truth and flag the discrepancy rather than silently reconciling it. This is a useful ground-truth trap to see whether an LLM notices or papers over it.